            <ArticleTitle>The Health of the Nation 4 years on: what have we done, what must we do?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>81-2, 99-100</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Health of the Nation programme has been running for 4 years. We have made real progress on many of the targets but on a few key ones we appear to be having little impact. The concern is that we are storing up problems for the future. To tackle these, we need a sustained programme of action, and clinicians have an important role to play.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
